      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For the Eurostar, standard luggage allowances generally permit one carry-on bag and one large suitcase, but it's best to check the specific current policies on the official Eurostar website. Since you have heavy bags, plan to arrive at St Pancras at least 45 minutes to an hour before departure to allow ample time for check-in and security. This extra time should help alleviate any stress during the boarding process.",
